# Base URL of the deployed Cloudflare Worker (no trailing slash).
#
# Optional. Without it the app is fully functional for typed questions — all
# retrieval is client-side — but four things are unavailable, because each of
# them needs a server for a reason other than speed:
#
#   voice input     Sarvam authenticates with a custom HTTP header, which a
#                   browser cannot set on a WebSocket handshake
#   spoken answers  the ElevenLabs and Sarvam keys must not ship to the client
#   adding a link   a browser cannot read the body of a cross-origin page
#   LLM rewrite     the Anthropic key must not ship to the client
#
# With no Worker the interface falls back to the browser's own speech APIs for
# voice, clearly labelled as a fallback in the UI. That exists so the app is
# demonstrable without keys — it is not what satisfies the voice requirement.
#
# VITE_WORKER_BASE=https://chehrag-worker.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev
